#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Mung siji model pasuryan sing didaftar. Cahya ngganti tampilan pasurya"
"n sampeyan menyang kamera, dadi model siji bisa gagal ing wayah sore i"
"ng ngisor lampu (utawa ing wayah awan). Tambah model kapindho sing dir"
"ekam ing cahya sing beda-beda supaya bisa mbukak kunci sing bisa diper"
"caya kapan wae."

