#: src/main.glade:448
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, t"
"hen reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Kabar desktop ditampilake nalika Ubuntu Hello nggoleki pasuryan sampey"
"an, banjur lapor asile. Usaha sing gagal tetep ana ing dhaptar kabar."

#: src/main.glade:475
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Tampilake kabar"

#: src/main.glade:483
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the re"
"sult."
msgstr ""
"Siji kertu saben nyoba bukti asli pasuryan, dianyari ing panggonan kar"
"o asil."

#: src/main.glade:530
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Swara kabar"

#: src/main.glade:538
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Puter swara sistem kanggo nyoba dikenali utawa gagal."

#: src/main.glade:585
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Kalebu diagnostik"

#: src/main.glade:593
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to e"
"ach card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tambah model, kepastian vs batesan, pigura, kamera lan wektu kanggo sa"
"ben kertu. Migunani nalika nglaporake masalah."

#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis Mbukak Kunci"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake otentikasi pasuryan supaya otomatis mbukak kunci kunci mlebu "
"utawa KWallet nalika mlebu. Iki kanthi aman nyimpen tembung sandhi sin"
"g disegel ing TPM yen kasedhiya, utawa dienkripsi nganggo AES-256-GCM "
"nggunakake kunci master mung root. Setelan autentikasi pasuryan PAM_AU"
"THTOK kanggo pam_gnome_keyring utawa pam_kwallet5 gumantung ing deskto"
"p sampeyan."

